#showas:颠覆
A rather fun and odd scenario. An increased number of factions, and it's set to difficulty 7.
This difficulty is good for someone who has spent some time in AI War 2.

This is on the "clusters microcosm" map type, with 100 planets. Tsunami AI type, which is heavily focused on launching waves at you, at the expense of pretty much anything else.
Your starting fleet is set to "Classic," which has the most basic available options.

The main focus here however, are 3 Nanocaust factions, all at Intensity 7 and hostile to everyone. They are a mechanical plague, spreading from planet to planet infecting ships which it will then send back at their enemies. They will invade later into the game, so you have some time to prepare.

They are hostile to each other as well, so this can lead to very interesting and amusing clashes over territory, as well as them stealing each others units back and forth.